" Colemak navigation shared by Vim, Neovim, and VSCodeVim.
noremap <C-h> h
noremap <C-n> j
noremap <C-e> k
noremap <C-i> l

" Move while staying in Insert mode.
inoremap <C-h> <C-o>h
inoremap <C-n> <C-o>j
inoremap <C-e> <C-o>k
inoremap <C-i> <C-o>l

" Escape from Insert mode without leaving the Colemak home row.
inoremap dh <Esc>
